pickCompany.prompt:
From this list of companies: {companies}

Iteration: {iteration}
Previous analysis covered: {company_analysis}

Pick the next company to analyze that hasn't been covered yet. Return ONLY the company name, nothing else. If all companies have been analyzed, return 'ALL_DONE'.

decide.prompt:
Companies list: {companies}
Iteration: {iteration}
Company just analyzed: {current_company}

Are there more companies from the list that haven't been analyzed yet? If yes, respond 'yes'. If all are done or {current_company} was 'ALL_DONE', respond 'done'.
